  "details": "Allow users be able to customize the cap of the room up to the max cap the given author has specified whenever making a new instance. That way rooms can have high caps and low caps to allow all types of events to occur without having to either create a new instance or change to public, friends or invite for a lower amount. A good example would be the time when MaTSix's SAO world had a cap size of 64. The feeling of a big area with lots of people in it felt invigorating. However when the cap was lowered to 24, that vast open area felt a lot more lonely. Everyone stuck to the giant circle in spawn instead of going out and searching for new things.",
